WEBVTT

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:04.560
I'm sorry, Bo.

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:07.440
It's just that I've been
lookin' forward to this all year.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:09.760
It's my one time
with just me and Andy. (GASPS)

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:11.760
You're cute when you care.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:15.960
-Bo, not in front of Buzz.
-(PURRS) Let him look.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.800
-(SHEEP BLEATING)
-Miss Peep, your sheep!

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.480
-(WHISTLES)
-(REX SCREAMS, GRUNTS)

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:24.240
This is Al from Al's Toy Barn,

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:25.680
-and I'm sittin' on good deals.
-Whoa!

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.560
Ow! I think I'm feeling
a deal hatching right now.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:32.520
Whoa! Let's see what we got. We got
boats for a buck, Beanies for a buck...

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.000
-Turn it off! Someone's gonna hear!
-Which one is off?

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.320
Buck, buck, buck!
And that's cheap, cheap, cheap!

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:38.520
So hurry on down...

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:39.840
For cryin' out loud, it's this one.

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:44.800
-I despise that chicken.
-Fellas! Fellas!

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:48.080
Okay, I got some good news,
and I got some bad news.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:49.720
What news?

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:52.080
The good news is
I found your hat, Woody.

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:55.760
My hat! Slink, thank you.
Thank you, thank you, thank you.

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:58.520
-Where'd you find it?
-Well, that's the bad news.

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:01.440
-(DOG BARKING)
-Oh, it's Buster!

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:04.280
SERGEANT: Canine alert!
Man your battle stations!

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:06.960
-Let's move, move, move!
-(BUSTER GROWLING)

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:09.640
-Woody! Hide! Quick!
-(WOODY GASPS)

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:11.640
(BARKING)

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:15.400
(CONTINUES BARKING)

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:16.880
(BEEPING ELECTRONICALLY)

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:19.560
(SNIFFING)

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:21.760
(CONTINUES BARKING)

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:26.280
(GROWLING)

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:28.880
(SNARLING)

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:33.320
(SPUTTERING) Okay, okay, okay.
Okay, okay! You found me!

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.160
Buster, all right. (GROANS)

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:36.720
Hey, how did he do, Hamm?

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:40.400
-Looks like a new record.
-Okay, boy. Sit.

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:42.960
-Reach for the sky.
-(WHIMPERING)

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:45.080
-Gotcha!
-(YELPS)

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:47.960
(CHUCKLES) Great job, boy.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.480
Who's gonna miss me
while I'm gone, huh?

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:51.560
Who's gonna miss me?

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:53.720
-Who's gonna miss me?
-(PANTING)

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.360
WOMAN: Andy, you got all your stuff?

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:57.200
Have a good weekend, everybody.
I'll see you Sunday night.

00:01:57.280 --> 00:01:59.040
It's in my room.

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:03.720
-(BARKING)
-Stick 'em up.

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:07.200
I guess we'll work on that later.

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:09.400
Hey, Woody.
Ready to go to cowboy camp?

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:12.760
Andy, honey, come on.
Five minutes, and we're leavin'.

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:15.760
Five minutes. Hmm.

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.280
Help, help! Somebody help me!

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:20.400
Let her go, evil Dr. Pork Chop!

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:21.880
ANDY: (EVIL VOICE) Never!

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:25.720
You must choose, Sheriff Woody.
How shall she die?

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:30.720
Shark, or death by monkeys?
(IMITATES MONKEY CHITTERING)

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:31.960
Choose!

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:34.320
ANDY: (IMITATING WOODY)
I choose Buzz Lightyear!

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.600
What? That's not a choice!

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:38.800
ANDY: (IMITATING BUZZ)
To infinity and beyond!

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:44.920
-I'll save you, Miss Peep.
-My hero. (IMITATES KISSING)

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.440
ANDY: (AS WOODY) Thanks, Buzz.
ANDY: (AS BUZZ) No problem, buddy.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.480
You should never tangle
with the unstoppable duo

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:52.080
of Woody and Buzz Lightyear!

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:54.800
Oh, no.

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:58.520
Andy, let's go!
Molly's already in her car seat.

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:02.120
-But, Mom, Woody's arm ripped.
-Oh, no.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:05.920
-Maybe we can fix him on the way.
-No, just leave him.

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:10.800
I'm sorry, honey,
but you know toys don't last forever.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:13.360
(SIGHS)

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:18.600
(GASPS)

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:25.040
-What happened?
-Woody's been shelved.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:26.160
(REX GASPS)

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:34.320
Andy!

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:53.720
SLINKY: Woody?

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:56.760
BO PEEP: Woody?
Honey, are you okay?

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:18.400
ANDY: Yee-haw! Ride 'em, cowboy!
(WHOOPS)

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:21.440
He's back?
Hey, everybody! Andy's back!

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:23.000
He's back early from cowboy camp!

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:27.040
-Places, everybody! Andy's coming!
-(ALL GASPING, CHATTERING)

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.120
Yeah!

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:32.040
(HUMMING LONE RANGER
THEME SONG)

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.920
Hey, Woody! Did you miss me?

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:36.680
Giddyap, giddyap, giddyap.
Ride 'em, cowboy!

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:41.920
Ohh. I forgot. You're broken.

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:45.200
I don't wanna play with you anymore.

